{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","title":"SkeletonComponentTokens Implementations"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/colorBg","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/colorGradientMiddle","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/colorGradientStartEnd"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeskeletoncomponenttokensprovider\/skeletoncomponenttokens-implementations"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider\/SkeletonComponentTokens-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider"]]},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSkeletonComponentTokensProvider":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of skeleton","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"skeleton","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"code":"OUDSSkeleton","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thi